I inspected all engine files (top-level, `cache/`, `prefill/`, `executor/`, `bitmap_recycle/`). Only **two** concrete candidates survived verification, both in `DecodeJob.java`. The bitmap/pool/size-math files (`LruBitmapPool`, `LruArrayPool`, `SizeConfigStrategy`, `MemorySizeCalculator`, `LruResourceCache`) were correctly skipped per the exclusions.

