- **Dead private code (category 1): NONE.** Every `private` method/field I checked is referenced within its own file (e.g., `releaseInternal`, `getNextStage`, `isHardwareBitmap`, `logWithTimeAndKey`, all `ReleaseManager`/`DeferredEncodeManager` members in `DecodeJob`; `resetDiskCache` in `DiskLruCacheWrapper`; `getCoreCountPre17` in `RuntimeCompat`; etc.).

